{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0114_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7dacd75a1067c65ea760c8c83294a230fc8cfe5604fda8464d65e176aa30326b", "ja": "（今日は百貨店の販促ポスターの撮影日だ。\n星梨花の調子はどうかな……）", "zh": "（今天是拍摄百货公司促销活动海报的日子，\n星梨花的状况不知道如何……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0114_1001_022ser", "source_sha256": "d58e529858f3ac6cd72ff184d1cab26248b466cc1f92b87b6433b65f5ce3ffe7", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです！\nあの、ちょっと相談に乗ってもらえますか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦了！\n那个，可以和你商量一件事情吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0114_1002_p", "source_sha256": "cc8ba772e6b99bdffb4abc14c0e0d959893e418c7ff73c07f9576538206579b4", "ja": "いいけど、どうかしたのか？", "zh": "可以呀，怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0114_1003_022ser", "source_sha256": "2582093a918240d99af1e2cdd75895d8758696deb92d26b813c56e1f2937ae22", "ja": "えっと、今回のポスター、わたしは\nプレゼントの妖精なんだそうです。", "zh": "是这样的，在这次的海报里，\n我好像要化身成礼物妖精。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0114_1004_022ser", "source_sha256": "07db8492e98057cc9a7fab3bc069a78956312318b02b76bb271118c9b325ad79", "ja": "プレゼントの妖精は、プレゼントたちの味方。\nお客さんとの素敵な出会いを魔法で彩る……。", "zh": "礼物妖精是礼物的好伙伴，\n会用魔法为礼物与客人的美好相遇增添色彩……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0114_1005_022ser", "source_sha256": "da52fde95081232de057b458bb558f760aaa4dec9dc7bf54f357759a26a867d9", "ja": "スタッフさんが、そう説明してくれたんですけど。\nわたし、うまくイメージできなくて……。", "zh": "工作人员是这样跟我说明的，\n但我不太能想像……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0114_1006_p", "source_sha256": "32ea7d203801d9d1c079d9c625014c578e830108c78c8200198afc29e2806ba9", "ja": "なるほど……じゃあ、一緒に考えてみようか。", "zh": "原来如此……那我们就一起来思考吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0114_1007_p", "source_sha256": "ab49db3dc4ecc859a7f99babb2b7295b56df0fad619a82e9b1350cf8383a6e06", "ja": "星梨花はもし自分がプレゼントだったら、\n誰に買って欲しいと思う？", "zh": "如果星梨花自己是礼物的话，\n会希望被谁买下呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0114_1008_022ser", "source_sha256": "5867f3d4ffdcbbaf8e5e1d3846a199ae43ee36dec50b092e64c691af11dbe70d", "ja": "わたしがプレゼントだったら、ですか？", "zh": "「如果我是礼物」吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0114_1009_p", "source_sha256": "0012dd6d89df226f69a209af16c5411fcf11d43ed95bd64a28679d4f1e883062", "ja": "うん。星梨花は百貨店の棚に並べられて、お客さんが\n手に取ってくれる瞬間を、じっと待ってるんだ。", "zh": "嗯，假设你被陈列在百货公司的货架上，\n一直等待被客人伸手拿起来的瞬间。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0114_1010_022ser", "source_sha256": "5ffd331996c17c7d6bfdccb849e850e606ac25c3e07d642c138eb8e76315c5f9", "ja": "えっと……あっ！　それならわたしは、\n{$P$}さんに買ってほしいです！", "zh": "我想想……啊！这样的话，\n我希望被{$P$}先生买下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0114_1011_p", "source_sha256": "c2f81f4aa11e641df724ae10818681c73dad664dc6c974595446d66eb89177de", "ja": "えっ？　俺に？", "zh": "咦？我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0114_1012_022ser", "source_sha256": "d67d550c7b4e10dc6c3a97f0fe19ccbe355ba40edc2957e61aaaf8a79d718219", "ja": "はい。{$P$}さんが、大切な\n誰かのために、心をこめて選んだプレゼント……。", "zh": "是的，{$P$}先生为了重要的人\n用心挑选的礼物……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0114_1013_022ser", "source_sha256": "ff0b265300dd6b33e2144b55231b73173b2418fa5ef0c8d66235efd717157b73", "ja": "それが『わたし』だったら、\nすごくうれしいなって思いました！", "zh": "如果就是「我」的话，\n我会很开心的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0114_1014_p", "source_sha256": "544d7dfdda77a0e4a4ad1925ad45acd3d81d7507db05153870460f78a01cf532", "ja": "そ、そうか、それは俺も嬉しいな……。とまあ、そう\nいう出会いを演出するのが、妖精のお仕事だと思うよ。", "zh": "这、这样啊，那我也会很开心……\n总之，我认为安排这样的相遇，就是妖精的工作喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0114_1015_022ser", "source_sha256": "198eab3db669c7f5e3f694cb0b5385fe18060778e7c7aba1a053a7aad98ca5a2", "ja": "{$P$}さんの、うれしい出会い……！\nわぁ♪　わたし、わかった気がします！", "zh": "{$P$}先生开心的相遇……！\n哇♪我好像明白了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0114_1016_022ser", "source_sha256": "a4fa56e48cbce50d7eb63e0a98e76bbbe6b2274431de3a94345a1b5a4c5ee47b", "ja": "プレゼントの妖精の、大事なお仕事。\nそれって、つまり……。", "zh": "礼物妖精的重要工作，\n那就是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0114_1017_022ser", "source_sha256": "6251ad513fa3c2d877f0ad560d811d586ffccdaba15f9081ec40c501814c6eb9", "ja": "プレゼントが{$P$}さんみたいな人と\n出会えるように、魔法をかけることなんですね！", "zh": "施展魔法，让礼物能跟\n像{$P$}先生一样的人相遇吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0114_1018_p", "source_sha256": "e34896280acb13681465cfb078da6bb532b3f2ccdb9c290c466870f152070714", "ja": "え～っと……\nうん、だいたいそんな感じでいいと思う！", "zh": "呃……\n嗯，应该差不多就是这样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0114_1019_022ser", "source_sha256": "a34c003f1899dd13e2cda189ecdee8163f7339636fff35b38f3de44f18c6244d", "ja": "よかったー！　ありがとうございます、\n{$P$}さん。", "zh": "太好了～！谢谢你，\n{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0114_1020_022ser", "source_sha256": "54ebafec342fae99091729e566879a0551a253e9decce9d555d43dfe42c949f5", "ja": "わたし、もう大丈夫です。ステキなプレゼントの魔法、\nたくさんかけられるようにがんばります♪", "zh": "我现在没问题了，\n我会努力多多施展美妙的礼物魔法♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0114_1021_p", "source_sha256": "b51e0d4f2dcf1120ada85e3c47c8a218996c3860654c8d8c6964f56172eb9e4e", "ja": "ああ、行ってこい！\n星梨花の妖精、楽しみにしてるよ。", "zh": "嗯，去吧！\n我很期待星梨花扮演的妖精喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0114_1022_022ser", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0114_1023_p", "source_sha256": "538968213c74be030f043284d1b8081dbcf479bb1ec60b95130bd366e78726f0", "ja": "（納得できたのか、満面の笑みを浮かべている。\nプレゼントよりも妖精の方が、魅力的に見えそうだ！）", "zh": "（大概是认同了我的解释，星梨花露出灿烂的笑容。\n看来妖精会比礼物更吸引人呢！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
